message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Balance — The Un-Buyable Recommender: design, test stand, and predictor program"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "131ym"
date-released: "2026-07-16"
version: "0.1.0"
url: "https://github.com/131ymm-commits/balance"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An outcome-ranked, structurally un-buyable recommender design, together with
  a pre-registered, falsifiable agent-based test stand. Main finding: the honest
  index has no endogenous growth loop under time, seeding, retention, retro-audit,
  signal network effects, coalition stimulus, Schelling focal forecasts or
  performative forecasting; the single sufficient, reproducible condition for
  sustained growth is an irreversible reduction of the switching cost.
